<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<style>
.legal-container {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 2rem auto 4rem auto;
  padding: 2.5rem;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
}

.legal-header {
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
  padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.legal-header h1 {
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: #222222;
}

.legal-section-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #222222;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.legal-text {
  color: #555555;
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}
</style>

<div class="legal-container">
  <div class="legal-header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: "long", day: "numeric", year: "numeric" }) %></p>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-content">
    <p class="legal-text">
      At Wanderlust, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy describes how Wanderlust collects, uses, and discloses your personal information when you use our platform, website, and services.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">1. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      We collect information you provide directly to us when creating an account, publishing a listing, submitting reviews, or contacting support. This includes your name, email address, property details, and uploaded media.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      We use your information to facilitate property bookings, display listings, maintain user profiles, ensure community safety, communicate updates, and continuously improve the Wanderlust experience.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">3. Data Sharing & Security</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      Wanderlust does not sell your personal data. We implement industry-standard encryption and security measures to protect your personal details against unauthorized access or disclosure.
    </p>

    <h3 class="legal-section-title">4. Your Rights & Choices</h3>
    <p class="legal-text">
      You have full control over your account settings and profile data. You may request account deletion or data exports at any time by contacting our support team.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top">
    <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-1"></i> Back to Listings
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
